message: "If you reference these contributor instructions, please cite them as below."
title: "Medical Physics Community Code Exchange: contributor instructions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anderson
    given-names: Brian M.
    affiliation: "University of California San Diego, Radiation Medicine and Applied Sciences"
